        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You have just discovered a piece of my heart.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/bf826923d72695433eeaf2a7dfad7215.poster.avif?t=1757530903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/bf826923d72695433eeaf2a7dfad7215.webm?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/bf826923d72695433eeaf2a7dfad7215.mp4?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of a sweet old lady, who is trying to reconnect with her granddaughter. Enjoy your cozy routine, like baking buns, feeding the birdies, and keeping your soul intact.  Eventually, take care of an <i>unexpected guest</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/c25df744aab8c80abbccc4ab0a1471ea.poster.avif?t=1757530903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/c25df744aab8c80abbccc4ab0a1471ea.webm?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/c25df744aab8c80abbccc4ab0a1471ea.mp4?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt and emotional story about an old lady and the One Who’s Waiting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15–20 minutes of first-person  gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, soothing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, cozy environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden secret waiting to be discovered on the map.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W, A, S, D – Walk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F – Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R – Open reminder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E – Light a candle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RB – Pick up fire lamp</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.poster.avif?t=1757530903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.webm?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.mp4?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>We'll meet again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
