li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15–20 minutes of first-person  gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming, soothing music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful, cozy environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden secret waiting to be discovered on the map.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W, A, S, D – Walk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F – Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R – Open reminder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E – Light a candle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RB – Pick up fire lamp</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.poster.avif?t=1757530903\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.webm?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788080/extras/cc00d13cfeae720a4956e2f9a57e4a19.mp4?t=1757530903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>We'll meet again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
